Maintainer: Jae <jae@devbyjae.com>
Homepage: https://devbyjae.com
Description: DBJ RattleNIX - Modern COFDM Acoustic Text Modem & CW Decoder
 DBJ RattleNIX is a modern, high-speed acoustic text modem and CW ID decoder
 for Linux. It supports Ribbit / Rattlegram COFDM acoustic audio packets,
 3-way color theming (Dark, Charcoal, Light), OTA self-updating, and
 real-time vectorized Morse code decoding with a glassmorphic web UI.
